  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "DotCov 4.1.0 adds to the 4.0 agent contract without changing it.\ndiff accepts --exclude-generated, --exclude-test-code and --keep, applied to both reports and listed as excluded/exclusionRules in JSON.\n--no-color is accepted by every command that reads a report, so a script can pass it everywhere.\n4.0 changed three contracts (verdict on stderr, exit 6 for a failed test run, the JSON envelope); see the 4.0.0 notes.\nFull notes: https://github.com/ANcpLua/dotcov/blob/main/docs/releases/4.1.0.md",
